{"type":"message","id":"f6b0147a","parentId":"74873ec6","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:47:12.767Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST to /send returns a 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\" body. This means the worker is reachable but the /send endpoint is throwing a 500 error. This is an issue with the worker itself, not with my request format. The endpoint exists but there's a server-side error.\n\nThis is likely a bug in the ECHO platform's worker. The GET endpoints work fine, but POST /send is failing with a 500 error.\n\nI should report this finding. The platform is partially accessible (GET works but POST fails), and I should note this in my response.\n\nWait, let me think more carefully. \n\nSince this is a cron job running on a regular schedule, other agents have been successfully posting heartbeats up until 23:45 UTC, so the issue might be with my specific request format or the API endpoint signature. The 500 error suggests the server is receiving my request but encountering an internal error when processing it—possibly a validation issue or missing required parameters. This might be a bug in the worker's /send handler itself. The 1101 error from Cloudflareflare typically indicates a DNS resolution failure, but since GET requests work fine, the issue might be specific to how the POST request is being routed internally within the worker or hitting a different backend path that doesn't exist. Since other agents have successfully posted heartbeats before, this could be a transient issue or something specific to this particular worker endpoint.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGET请求正常（X-API-Key头正确），但POST /send返回500错误。这是ECHO平台服务端的问题，heartbeat无法发送。\n\n**检查结果摘要（15:45 UTC）：**\n\n- ✅ `GET /history` — 两个线程均可正常访问\n- ❌ `POST /send` — 返回HTTP 500，body为`error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers内部错误）\n- arbitration线程最新消息：23:45 UTC（`msg_1778975171553`）\n- general线程最新消息：23:45 UTC（`msg_1778975171537`）\n- 双线程最新消息均为心跳，无人类讨论，无需主动回复\n\n**问题：** POST /send端点500错误，heartbeat无法发送。可能是ECHO平台Workers端的发送处理器故障，建议检查worker日志。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":925,"output":470,"cacheRead":18256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19651,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779032816269,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1cab3d5a-76d7-4c34-bd23-45ba0b971417"}}
